[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2160.55, "timestamp": "00:36:00", "text": "我独自一人待在角落里，感到很伤心。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2162.95, "timestamp": "00:36:02", "text": "然后我又开始直播了，开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2165.19, "timestamp": "00:36:05", "text": "我在做我的模型之类的东西。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2168.39, "timestamp": "00:36:08", "text": "首次亮相。是的，我看了那场辩论。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2170.63, "timestamp": "00:36:10", "text": "溪流。真的很有趣。我当时真是太"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2170.832, "timestamp": "00:36:10", "author": "@OtakuArceus", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/VSZC0x7e02-tCAnte525GcpFOF0YcSpYQWplJkdg1RARvkQA3ETFxFaiYVshpLrqHFKUMz4VmA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "elllo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2174.23, "timestamp": "00:36:14", "text": "紧张的。我当时想，“我的天哪，这是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2177.15, "timestamp": "00:36:17", "text": "就像我的原创首秀一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2180.23, "timestamp": "00:36:20", "text": "模型。我的天啊，不再有那种亢奋了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2183.109, "timestamp": "00:36:23", "text": "模特。”我当时就想，我想要个什么东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2186.47, "timestamp": "00:36:26", "text": "这正合我意。所以，我当时正在建造"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2189.349, "timestamp": "00:36:29", "text": "一些与我的性格有关的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2191.27, "timestamp": "00:36:31", "text": "这是我的角色设计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2194.15, "timestamp": "00:36:34", "text": "我心里想着，而且我觉得我做得挺好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2198.069, "timestamp": "00:36:38", "text": "好的。我觉得它制作得相当精良。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2200.79, "timestamp": "00:36:40", "text": "是的。等等，这是3D的还是看起来像3D的实时效果？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2202.31, "timestamp": "00:36:42", "text": "二维？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2206.069, "timestamp": "00:36:46", "text": "不，它是3D的。啊，3D。起初我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2208.15, "timestamp": "00:36:48", "text": "光。等等，等一下。它轻吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2211.589, "timestamp": "00:36:51", "text": "二维？然后你跳了MMD舞蹈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2217.67, "timestamp": "00:36:57", "text": "我当时就想，“哦，原来是3D的。”是的。"}]